title AVG-05 Update a Live Service in AVG
participant Maker_or_Client_Admin
participant Zetrix_Registry_Admin
participant DNS_Resolver
participant Checker_or_Client_Admin
participant AVG
participant SSIVC
participant MBI
participant Zetrix_HSM
participant Zetrix_Registry
participant OpenAgenet
==SUBMIT UPDATE==
Maker_or_Client_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:submit update (changed fields, higher version)
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:validate fields; version > current; type unchanged; no other pending update
alt ENDPOINT DOMAIN CHANGED
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->DNS_Resolver:check TXT record on new domain
DNS_Resolver-->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:found
end
Zetrix_Registry_Admin-->Maker_or_Client_Admin:update pending approval; service keeps running on current details
==APPROVE UPDATE==
Checker_or_Client_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:approve update
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:approver is not submitter
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->AVG:update registration (credential, claims, callback)
AVG-->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:ok (API key, secret, did:zid, did:oan unchanged)
alt SERVICE NAME OR ENDPOINT DOMAIN CHANGED
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->SSIVC:issue new Service Cert, revoke old
SSIVC->MBI:issue new VC, revoke old VC
MBI-->SSIVC:new Service Cert ID
SSIVC-->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:new Service Cert ID
end
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->Zetrix_Registry:update listing (new version)
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->Zetrix_HSM:sign new DID document version with did:oan key
Zetrix_HSM-->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:proof
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->OpenAgenet:submit new package version (async, retry)
Zetrix_Registry_Admin-->Checker_or_Client_Admin:update live
alt UPDATE REJECTED
Zetrix_Registry_Admin-->Maker_or_Client_Admin:rejected with reason; service unchanged
end
